      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LIL REX (8) was an impressive winner last time in quickest time of the meeting when scoring by 7 lengths (34.19) at Angle Park. Goes very well at the trip finding the frame in each of 11 starts. Well placed and will be tough to beat. LAMIA TAYA (6) comes into this as a quickest on the card winner last time at this track, scoring by 9 lengths (29.79). Looks a primary danger. OREGON JANET (4) tackled far tougher grade latest but ran very well to hit the frame when 2nd (43.98) at Angle Park in Grade 3/4/5. Won an easier race the start before that at Angle Park. Goes very well here finding the frame in each of five starts. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Expected to be in this for a long way. MISS LUCY (2) is a last start winner who can measure up again.",
